================================================================================
🔟 FINAL GOLDEN RULE (VERY IMPORTANT)
================================================================================

✔ If YOU create the scope →
  YOU must provide:
  Dispatcher + Job

✔ If Kotlin / Android provides the scope →
  Dispatcher + Job are already included
*/
